OL,3,ACarney gambles on the world's biggest
OL,4,Ainvestors betting on Canada
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's been a little over 18 months since
OL,7,FCanadian Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,8,Fsaid his country's relationship with
OL,9,Fthe United States, based on over a
OL,10,Fcentury of tight economic and military
OL,11,Fcooperation, was "over".
OL,13,FTrade talks collapsing, tit-for-tat
OL,14,Ftariffs, and Donald Trump's talk of
OL,15,Fmaking Canada a "51st state" have all
OL,16,Ffuelled this bitter feud between the
OL,17,Ftwo North American neighbours.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,117,105,200,300,0,100
