OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACarney gambles on the world's biggest
OL,4,Ainvestors betting on Canada
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, as Canada's top pitch man, Carney
OL,7,Fis looking to leverage personal
OL,8,Frelationships from his time spent in
OL,9,Fthe top tiers of global finance to woo
OL,10,Fsome of the world's wealthiest asset
OL,11,Fmanagers and business leaders to bet on
OL,12,Fhis country.
OL,14,FFor two days, Toronto will host more
OL,15,Fthan 100 global investors overseeing
OL,16,Fmore than C$100tn ($72tn; #53tn) in
OL,17,Fassets, in the hope that new economic
OL,18,Frelationships will help Canada navigate
OL,19,Fan increasingly unstable geopolitical
OL,20,Fclimate.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
